{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lucas lives in a ranch with his grandpa, Mr. Lon, unaware that Supremetoid, a terrible space villain, is preparing an assault along his hordes of alien soldiers. His goal: destroy all the chickens his ship's radar can find!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682920/extras/4b748e4bfe330e29c8105bc6328a408f.avif?t=1768575968\" width=630 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When they least expect it, the villain fires a beam that opens portals on Mr. Lon\u2019s ranch and the neighboring farms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682920/extras/9b57bb5dbbeddf51667f0a1c31530828.avif?t=1768575968\" width=630 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chupacabras, Barataliens, Vespaliens, Ogralines, and other abominable enemies spread across the ranches, causing chaos and destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682920/extras/3570985eb2d476142e1d0cb97ed0b8ac.avif?t=1768575968\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682920/extras_big/3570985eb2d476142e1d0cb97ed0b8ac.avif?t=1768575968 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682920/extras/556ac511aa2aa148d175f10127e1633b.avif?t=1768575968\" width=630 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now it\u2019s up to Lucas to mount a defense against the alien hordes to save the chickens from being destroyed by the <strong>Chicken Coop Invaders</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682920/extras/5bd0b603fdaf77c5f139cd77786bf807.avif?t=1768575968\" width=630 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense FPS action mechanics with Tower Defense elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40 different invasion levels (plus one ultra-secret stage to unlock)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >410 chickens to save!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3682920?t=1768575968","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3682920?t=1768575968","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682920/738c2dca26d33ec90d2c64e35d67ccaac0d5e6ce/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768575968","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682920/738c2dca26d33ec90d2c64e35d67ccaac0d5e6ce/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768575968","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lucas lives in a ranch with his grandpa, Mr. Lon, unaware that Supremetoid, a terrible space villain, is preparing an assault along his hordes of alien soldiers. His goal: destroy all the chickens his ship's radar can find!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img